  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Kapag naka-on, ang larawan mo ang pinapatungan ng app at tinatabunan ito ng artwork habang nasa isang pelikula o palabas ka. Kapag naka-off, nananatili ang larawan at wala kailanman tumatabon dito.",
